## Interface: 20506
## Category: Commander
## Title: Commander Orders
## Author: Devin
## Version: 3.0.0
## Notes: The suite's own navigation, in place of TomTom. A smooth arrow with distance and arrival time that lets clicks through until you hold Shift, and says plainly when it cannot point (another continent, inside an instance, on a taxi). Pins on the minimap and the world map, Ctrl+Right-click on the map to drop a waypoint, /way, routes, named places, a manager window with a paste box for /way lists, group sharing that never takes your arrow, the corpse run, and Questie's TomTom requests answered. Waypoints are kept per character and belong to whoever set them, so a quest button or a corpse never wipes out your own.
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\Ability_Warrior_RallyingCry
